<section class="wrap prose page-head">
  <h1>Get Started in Ham Radio</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Getting a ham radio license in the United States is easier than most people expect.
    You study, pass a multiple-choice exam, and the FCC issues you a callsign. Here is the whole path, in plain English.
  </p>
